(* This model does not prove: the verdict partition (P4, TLA+); that   *)
(* acceptance is fresh or context-bound (replay is permitted, §A3.1    *)
(* item 1); re-attribution of honest bytes to another key (S-P3,       *)
(* complementary — composed at the capstone, not consumed here); the   *)
(* multi-signer set (S-P2); canonicalization or the frame's byte       *)
(* layout (P8); wrapper soundness (P7); anything temporal (P5/P6);     *)
(* the verification profile (H1a); the first link itself (consumed     *)
